$NetBSD$

Preserve valid zero RTP clock origins and modular first-packet offsets.
Track RTP/RTCP/RTSP initialization explicitly, reset it on RTSP play/seek,
and retain rtptime=0 while rejecting absent or invalid RTP-Info clocks.
Initialize unknown parser byte positions at zero while preserving packet
position metadata and actual timestamps. This lets the first RTP AU retain PTS.
AI-assisted EmberBSD adaptation of FFmpeg 9.0.2; not submitted or accepted
upstream. Original FFmpeg authorship and LGPL remain.

